From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ThaRae <76752281+ThaRae@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:44:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] LibWebView: Never destroy a closed PiP window after the
 Application

A Picture-in-Picture window whose page closed was destroyed by a
deferred invocation that held it, once the callback it closed from
returned. When the event loop is torn down before running it, as it can
be at the end of TestPictureInPictureUserActivation, the window was
destroyed with the event queue, after the Application. Its view's
destructor then asked the Application for its spell checker, and
crashed.

The manager now keeps the window until that invocation runs, so a
queue destroyed without running it destroys nothing. The window then
lives as long as the manager does, as open and retired windows do.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.cpp | 6 +++++-
 Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.h   | 1 +
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.cpp b/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.cpp
index a87f0102a8bfd9b09bfa59160017e396cbfedeb9..3d384954150f0f556e9747dad93856b15b7d47a1 100644
--- a/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.cpp
+++ b/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.cpp
@@ -154,7 +154,11 @@ void PictureInPictureManager::window_page_did_close(PictureInPictureWindow& wind
     }
 
     // The window's page closes from within a callback of its view, so the window is destroyed once that returns.
-    Core::deferred_invoke([closed_window = move(closed_window)] { });
+    if (closed_window)
+        m_closed_windows.append(closed_window.release_nonnull());
+    Core::deferred_invoke([] {
+        auto closed_windows = move(PictureInPictureManager::the().m_closed_windows);
+    });
 }
 
 }
diff --git a/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.h b/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.h
index 9c5a543f0162a3cd2c73540fe409cbec1503ec42..9f5738822ca0944962a3d7af726de443d4a6e5d7 100644
--- a/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.h
+++ b/Libraries/LibWebView/PictureInPictureManager.h
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@ private:
 
     Vector<Window> m_windows;
     Vector<NonnullOwnPtr<PictureInPictureWindow>> m_retired_windows;
+    Vector<NonnullOwnPtr<PictureInPictureWindow>> m_closed_windows;
 };
 
 }
